/Title(M68HC11RM, M68HC11 - Reference Manual)/Author(Freescale Semiconductor, Inc.)/Subject(M68HC11RM: This reference manual is a valuable aid in the development of M68HC11 applications. The high-density complementary metal-oxide semiconductor (HCMOS) MC68HC11A8 is an advanced 8-bit MCU with highly sophisticated, on-chip peripheral capabilities. New design techniques were used to achieve a nominal bus speed of 2 MHz. In addition, the fully static design allows operation at frequencies down to dc, further reducing power consumption. )/Keywords(M68HC11RM, M68HC11, high-density complementary metal-oxide semiconductor (HCMOS), MC68HC11A8)
>>endobjxref
